  "name": "Chimes of Necros",
  "description": "Energy regenerates while this ability is not in use. Hold your Secondary Ability key to afflict every visible non-Undead creature within 15 blocks with Wither I for 2 seconds and 1 stack of \u00a7c\u00a7l[Doom]\u00a7r. The Wither duration increases by 1 second for each Energy consumed during the channel, up to 10 seconds.\n \nYou move 20% slower while channeling Chimes of Necros. Undead creatures are immune. On the 10th Doom stack, the target takes 20 magic damage, gains Wither II for 5 seconds, and all Doom stacks are cleared."
